BeamName,omnislash dash,sunek omnislasha
CharacterName,Juggernaut,Juggernaut
CharacterName,Morphling,Morphling
ClassDescription,"A fluid DOTA2 hero who commands surging waves, shifts freely between Strength and Agility, empowers himself through Ebb & Flow, and morphs into foes.","Tekoči junak iz DOTA2, ki poveljuje deročim valovom, prosto pretaka Moč in Gibčnost, se krepi z Oseko in plimo ter prevzema podobo sovražnikov."
ClassDescription,"A masked DOTA2 blademaster who builds unstoppable momentum through Bladeform, carves through magic with Blade Fury, sustains allies with Healing Ward, and cuts down foes with Blade Dance and Omnislash.","Zamaskirani mojster meča iz DOTA2, ki z Obliko rezila kopiči neustavljiv zagon, z Besom rezila prebija magijo, z Zdravilnim totemom zdravi zaveznike ter s Plesom rezila in Omnislashem kosi sovražnike."
