EntityDescription,A floating restorative totem summoned by Juggernaut that heals nearby allies for a percentage of their maximum HP each turn.,"Lebdeči zdravilni totem, ki ga prikliče Juggernaut in vsako potezo zdravi bližnje zaveznike za odstotek njihovih največjih HP."
EntityDescription,"A sentient elemental forged from living tidewater, capable of reshaping its physical attributes at will.","Zavestni elemental, skovan iz žive plimske vode, ki zmore po mili volji preoblikovati svoje telesne lastnosti."
EntityName,healing ward,zdravilni totem
EntityName,waterkin,vodni duh
ExplosionName,blade fury spin,vrtinec besa rezila
ItemDescription,A condensed sphere of living tidewater launched as infinite ranged ammunition from a sling.,"Zgoščena krogla žive plimske vode, ki se izstreli iz prače kot neskončno strelivo na daljavo."
ItemName,tidal orb,krogla plime
PropertyDescription,Innate (Bladeform): Gain 1 stack every 4 turns without taking damage (up to 10 stacks). Each stack grants +1% movement speed and +2.5% agility strike power and attack speed; lingers 4 turns after taking damage.,"Prirojeno (Oblika rezila): Pridobite 1 naboj vsake 4 poteze brez prejete škode (do 10 nabojev). Vsak naboj podeli +1% hitrosti gibanja ter +2,5% moči udarcev iz gibčnosti in hitrosti napada; po prejeti škodi vztraja še 4 poteze."
PropertyDescription,Innate (Ebb & Flow): Agility grants bonus movement speed and ranged attack range; Strength grants bonus spell cast range and slow resistance. Persists while morphed.,Prirojeno (Oseka in plima): Gibčnost podeljuje dodatno hitrost gibanja in doseg na daljavo; Moč podeljuje dodaten doseg urokov in odpornost proti upočasnitvi. Ohrani se med preobrazbo.
PropertyDescription,Leaping between nearby enemies in a blur of invulnerable strikes: immune to all damage and debuffs while slashing a nearby foe each turn.,"Skakanje med bližnjimi sovražniki v vrtincu neranljivih udarcev: imunost na vso škodo in oslabitve, medtem ko vsako potezo zareže bližnjega sovražnika."
PropertyDescription,"Passive (Blade Dance): Melee attacks, Omnislash strikes, and Blade Fury spins have a 20% / 25% / 30% / 35% chance (by Blade Dance skill level 1-4) to critically strike for 1.8x damage.","Pasivno (Ples rezila): Napadi od blizu, udarci Omnislasha in vrtljaji Besa rezila imajo 20% / 25% / 30% / 35% možnosti (glede na stopnjo 1–4 Plesa rezila) za kritični udarec z 1,8-kratno škodo."
PropertyDescription,"Spinning in a destructive storm of blades: immune to debuffs, 80% magical damage reduction, and dealing magical damage around you each turn.","Vrtenje v uničujočem viharju rezil: imunost na oslabitve, 80% zmanjšanje magične škode ter zadajanje magične škode okoli vas vsako potezo."
PropertyName,blade dance,ples rezila
PropertyName,blade fury,bes rezila
PropertyName,bladeform,oblika rezila
PropertyName,ebb and flow,oseka in plima
PropertyName,omnislash,omnislash
