RaceName,waterkin//male,vodni duh
RaceName,waterkin//non-binary,vodni duh
SpellDescription,"Assume the form of a targeted creature, copying its body, attributes, skills, and spells while retaining Ebb & Flow.","Prevzemite podobo izbranega bitja ter posnemite njegovo telo, lastnosti, veščine in uroke, pri čemer ohranite Oseko in plimo."
SpellDescription,"Dispel debuffs and spin for 10 to 12 turns: debuff immunity, 80% magical DR, and 1d4 to 2d4+2 base magical damage per turn (85-205 DPS mapped via K_dmg=15, scaled by DEX & Bladeform attack speed) to adjacent 3x3 foes; can crit with Blade Dance.","Razpršite oslabitve in se vrtite 10 do 12 potez: imunost na oslabitve, 80% zmanjšanje magične škode in 1d4 do 2d4+2 osnovne magične škode na potezo (85–205 DPS prek K_dmg=15, preračunano z DEX in hitrostjo Oblike rezila) sosednjim sovražnikom 3x3; lahko sproži kritični udarec s Plesom rezila."
SpellDescription,"Dissolve into a surging wave, blinking forward, splashing water damage around you, and briefly gaining phasing and displacement.","Raztopite se v deročem valu, švignete naprej, poškropite okolico z vodno škodo ter za kratek čas pridobite prehodnost in premik."
SpellDescription,"Launch a surge of water dealing base damage, knocking back, and stunning the target. Bonus damage scales with Agility-to-Strength ratio while stun duration scales with Strength-to-Agility ratio.","Izstrelite vodni val, ki povzroči osnovno škodo, odbije in omami tarčo. Dodatna škoda je odvisna od razmerja Gibčnost/Moč, trajanje omame pa od razmerja Moč/Gibčnost."
SpellDescription,"Leap to a targeted enemy and unleash 5 to 12 rapid invulnerable weapon slashes (weapon + stat + 2 to 3 bonus damage per slash) across nearby foes, triggering Blade Dance crits and Bladeform bonuses.","Skočite na izbranega sovražnika in sprožite 5 do 12 hitrih neranljivih zamahov z orožjem (orožje + lastnost + 2 do 3 dodatne škode na zamah) čez bližnje sovražnike, kar sproža kritične udarce Plesa rezila in bonuse Oblike rezila."
SpellDescription,Release your morphed form and immediately return to your true waterkin body.,Opustite svojo preobraženo obliko in se takoj vrnite v svoje pravo telo vodnega duha.
SpellDescription,"Shift Agility into Strength and Constitution (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats while raising both maximum and current HP.","Prelijte Gibčnost v Moč in Konstitucijo (1 do 5 točk glede na mojstrstvo), pri čemer ohranite vsoto lastnosti in povišate tako največje kot trenutne HP."
SpellDescription,"Shift Strength and Constitution into Agility (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats and lowering maximum HP without draining current HP.","Prelijte Moč in Konstitucijo v Gibčnost (1 do 5 točk glede na mojstrstvo), pri čemer ohranite vsoto lastnosti in znižate največje HP brez odvzema trenutnih HP."
SpellDescription,"Summon a fragile movable Healing Ward (1 HP, max 1 active) for 36 to 48 turns that heals all allies within 2 tiles for 1% to 3.25% of their maximum HP each turn.","Prikličite krhek premični Zdravilni totem (1 HP, največ 1 dejaven) za 36 do 48 potez, ki vsako potezo pozdravi vse zaveznike v dosegu 2 polj za 1% do 3,25% njihovih največjih HP."
